  message: "P2 REVIEW 2026-09-25 (dev e4a47383ab). STILL REPRODUCES, AND GREW: 8 -> 11. Fresh full self-analysis survey at dev e4a47383ab (53,828 nodes). Nodes with stable_id None, by (language, kind):\n   json/package   3   (incl. the PRODUCTION path packages/htrac-frontend/package.json, as filed)\n   proto/message  2   (route-parity/grpc/user.proto)\n   toml/package   2   (was 1: +recorded/aardvark_dns/crate/Cargo.toml)\n   proto/method   1\n   bash/alias     1   (schema-coverage-corpus/bash/script.sh)\n   csharp/property 1  NEW (schema-coverage-corpus/csharp/Program.cs)\n   erlang/function 1  NEW (schema-coverage-corpus/erlang/logger_macro.erl)\nThe two new kinds, property and function, are ordinary callable/member kinds. That supports the row's hypothesis that the by-kind stable_id dispatch has no default arm, rather than a fixed list of exotic kinds. Growth since filing is +3 nodes, all under fixture paths except the htrac one. I did NOT re-locate the dispatch site (the row cites analyze/base.py:1122)."  # 5670
- op: discuss  # 18cd
  at: '2026-10-01T01:07:29Z'  # 18cd
  by: agent  # 18cd
